+#### Fix formatting when tag name is an object prototype property (#17501 by @fisker)
+
+<!-- prettier-ignore -->
+```html
+<!-- Input -->
+<constructor>
+	text
+</constructor>
+
+<!-- Prettier stable -->
+TypeError: Vn(...).startsWith is not a function
+
+<!-- Prettier main -->
+<constructor> text </constructor>
+```
