@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Format elements named after Object.prototype properties without a TypeError (tests/format/html/tags/object-prototype-properties/format.test.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 Print those elements inline with their text, like any unknown element (tests/format/html/tags/object-prototype-properties/format.test.js) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Read the CSS display table only through own keys in getNodeCssStyleDisplay (src/language-html/utils/index.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Read the CSS white-space table only through own keys in getNodeCssStyleWhiteSpace (src/language-html/utils/index.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Add the changelog entry (changelog_unreleased/html/17501.md)
